      "docs": "Studio is installed. Next steps:\n\n  1. pnpm dev \u2014 open http://localhost:3000\n  2. Click \"Connect API key\" in the sidebar and paste the API key copied from https://open.higgsfield.ai/api-keys\n  3. Generate.\n\nModels live in generation/catalog/models/ (one file each); the dev server picks up new ones live:\n  pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add higgsfield-ai/app-templates/models          # every model\n  pnpm dlx shadcn@latest add higgsfield-ai/app-templates/seedance-2.5    # one model\n  pnpm dlx shadcn@latest list higgsfield-ai/app-templates                # see what is available\n\nEnv (.env.local): HF_API_BASE_URL is set to https://api.higgsfield.ai. Reference uploads use your saved Higgsfield key and signed storage URLs; no separate storage token is needed.\n\nRead AGENTS.md before adapting the template.\n"
    }
